{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sekuu Identity — v1",
    "description": "Collection de test de l'API Sekuu Identity.\n\n## Démarrage\n\n1. Importer l'environnement `Sekuu-Local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Lancer `php artisan serve` (l'API répond sur http://localhost:8000).\n3. Exécuter les requêtes dans l'ordre des dossiers, ou lancer la collection entière avec le Collection Runner.\n\n## Ce qui est automatique\n\nLes scripts de test capturent et réinjectent les valeurs volatiles : `access_token`, `refresh_token`, `organization_id`, `workspace_id`, `membership_id`, `invitation_token`, `session_id`, `oauth_account_id`, ainsi que les jetons de réinitialisation et de vérification.\n\nVous n'avez donc rien à copier-coller entre les requêtes.\n\n## Jetons visibles\n\nLes jetons d'invitation, de réinitialisation et de vérification ne sont renvoyés par l'API qu'en environnement `local` et `testing`. En production, ils ne transitent que par Notify — les requêtes correspondantes échoueront donc hors développement, c'est voulu.\n\n## Contrat\n\nLa référence est `Modules/Identity/openapi.yaml`, tenue à jour par `OpenApiContractTest`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Contrôles appliqués à toutes les requêtes : ce sont les conventions",
          "// que les guidelines imposent à chaque API de la plateforme.",
          "if (pm.response.code !== 204 && pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')?.includes('json')) {",
          "  const body = pm.response.json();",
          "",
          "  pm.test('Enveloppe standard', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('success');",
          "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('meta');",
          "    pm.expect(body.meta).to.have.property('request_id');",
          "  });",
          "",
          "  pm.test('request_id present dans le header', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id')).to.eql(body.meta.request_id);",
          "  });",
          "",
          "  if (body.success === false) {",
          "    pm.test('Erreur avec un code stable', function () {",
          "      pm.expect(body.error).to.have.property('code');",
          "      pm.expect(body.error.code).to.match(/^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]+$/);",
          "    });",
          "  }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "email", "value": "nathan@sekuu.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "un-mot-de-passe-long" },
    { "key": "new_password", "value": "un-nouveau-mot-de-passe" },
    { "key": "invited_email", "value": "john@sekuu.com" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 — Service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/health", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "health"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Service operationnel', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Base de donnees joignable', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.checks.database).to.eql('ok'));"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "JWKS (clés publiques)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/.well-known/jwks.json", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": [".well-known", "jwks.json"] },
            "description": "Servi à la racine du domaine, hors préfixe de version : un chemin `.well-known` est normalisé, il ne peut pas être versionné.\n\nC'est ce document qui permet à un produit de vérifier un token sans détenir le moindre secret."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Une cle publique est publiee', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().keys.length).to.be.above(0));",
              "pm.test('Aucune cle privee exposee', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('PRIVATE'));"
            ]}
          }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 — Authentification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Inscription",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Nathan\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Tchinda\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Crée le compte, ouvre une session et émet une paire de jetons.\n\nUn jeton de vérification d'adresse est également émis. Il n'apparaît dans la réponse qu'en développement."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Compte cree', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access_token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', d.refresh_token);",
              "if (d.email_verification_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('verification_token', d.email_verification_token);",
              "pm.test('Le mot de passe n\\'est jamais renvoye', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include(pm.variables.get('password')));"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Connexion",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Connecte', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access_token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', d.refresh_token);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Connexion — mauvais mot de passe",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"ce-nest-pas-le-bon\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "À comparer avec la requête suivante : les deux réponses doivent être **identiques**. Toute différence permettrait d'énumérer les comptes existants."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(401); pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('INVALID_CREDENTIALS'); });",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('_msg_wrong_password', pm.response.json().error.message);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Connexion — compte inconnu",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"personne@sekuu.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(401); pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('INVALID_CREDENTIALS'); });",
              "pm.test('Indiscernable d\\'un mot de passe incorrect', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.message).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('_msg_wrong_password'));",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Profil (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Profil renvoye', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Contexte present', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.have.property('context'));"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Rafraîchir les jetons",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "Rotation : le jeton présenté est révoqué et remplacé.\n\nRejouer un jeton déjà utilisé est interprété comme un vol — toute la session tombe. Essayez de relancer cette requête deux fois de suite sans mettre à jour la variable."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Nouvelle paire emise', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('Le refresh token a change', () => pm.expect(d.refresh_token).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('refresh_token')));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access_token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', d.refresh_token);"
            ]}
          }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Organisations & contexte",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer une organisation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"SOS Clinique\",\n  \"country\": \"CM\",\n  \"currency\": \"XAF\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/organizations", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "organizations"] },
            "description": "Le créateur en devient `owner`."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Organisation creee', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('organization_id', pm.response.json().data.id);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mes organisations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/organizations", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "organizations"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Workspaces sans organisation active (403 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces"] },
            "description": "À lancer **avant** le changement d'organisation.\n\nUn token sans claim `org` n'ouvre que les routes de profil."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('403 ORGANIZATION_REQUIRED', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('ORGANIZATION_REQUIRED');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Changer d'organisation active",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"organization_id\": \"{{organization_id}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/switch-organization", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "switch-organization"] },
            "description": "Émet un nouvel access token portant `org`, `roles`, `scopes` et `products`.\n\nLe refresh token n'est pas touché : la session reste la même, seul le contexte change."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Token contextualise', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const token = pm.response.json().data.access_token;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', token);",
              "",
              "const claims = JSON.parse(atob(token.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
              "pm.test('Le claim org est present', () => pm.expect(claims.org).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('organization_id')));",
              "pm.test('Role owner', () => pm.expect(claims.roles).to.include('owner'));",
              "pm.test('Aucune donnee personnelle dans le token', function () {",
              "  const raw = JSON.stringify(claims);",
              "  pm.expect(raw).to.not.include('@');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Workspaces",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer un workspace",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Douala\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces"] },
            "description": "Requiert `workspace.create`. Le créateur en devient membre — sans quoi il ne verrait pas ce qu'il vient de créer."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Workspace cree', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('workspace_id', pm.response.json().data.id);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Lister les workspaces",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Détail d'un workspace",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces", "{{workspace_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modifier un workspace",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Douala — Bonanjo\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces", "{{workspace_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Membres du workspace",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/members", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces", "{{workspace_id}}", "members"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const members = pm.response.json().data;",
              "if (members.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('membership_id', members[0].membership_id);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Workspace inexistant (404 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces", "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"] },
            "description": "Un workspace appartenant à une autre organisation renvoie exactement la même réponse : son existence n'est jamais révélée."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('404 WORKSPACE_NOT_FOUND', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('WORKSPACE_NOT_FOUND');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Supprimer un workspace",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "workspaces", "{{workspace_id}}"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"] }
          }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 — Invitations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Rôles globaux disponibles",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"] },
            "description": "Identity n'expose pas encore d'endpoint de listing des rôles. En attendant, récupérez l'identifiant du rôle voulu en base :\n\n```sql\nSELECT id, slug FROM global_roles;\n```\n\net renseignez la variable `global_role_id` de l'environnement."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Inviter quelqu'un",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{invited_email}}\",\n  \"global_role_id\": \"{{global_role_id}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organization_id}}/invitations", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "organizations", "{{organization_id}}", "invitations"] },
            "description": "Requiert `users.invite`.\n\nLe jeton en clair n'est renvoyé qu'en développement : en production il n'existe que dans le message envoyé par Notify."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Invitation creee', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('invitation_id', d.id);",
              "if (d.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('invitation_token', d.token);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Invitations en attente",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organization_id}}/invitations", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "organizations", "{{organization_id}}", "invitations"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consulter l'invitation (public)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/invitations/{{invitation_token}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "invitations", "{{invitation_token}}"] },
            "description": "Le jeton fait office de preuve : il n'a été transmis qu'à l'adresse invitée.\n\nNi l'identifiant de l'invitation, ni celui de l'organisation, ni l'inviteur ne sont exposés."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Invitation lisible', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('Aucune information interne exposee', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(d).to.not.have.property('id');",
              "  pm.expect(d).to.not.have.property('invited_by');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Détournement par un autre compte (403 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/invitations/{{invitation_token}}/accept", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "invitations", "{{invitation_token}}", "accept"] },
            "description": "Ici le token du propriétaire est envoyé, alors que l'invitation vise quelqu'un d'autre.\n\nUne invitation ne peut pas être détournée par un compte connecté."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('403 INVITATION_EMAIL_MISMATCH', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('INVITATION_EMAIL_MISMATCH');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Accepter l'invitation (public)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"John\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n  \"password\": \"un-mot-de-passe-long\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/invitations/{{invitation_token}}/accept", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "invitations", "{{invitation_token}}", "accept"] },
            "description": "Les champs d'inscription ne sont requis que si aucun compte n'existe pour l'adresse invitée.\n\nL'adresse est alors considérée comme vérifiée : la réception du jeton le prouve."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Invitation acceptee', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Compte cree', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.account_created).to.be.true);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Révoquer une invitation",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/invitations/{{invitation_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "invitations", "{{invitation_id}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 — Mot de passe & vérification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mot de passe oublié",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"] },
            "description": "Répond **toujours** 202 avec le même message, que l'adresse existe, n'existe pas, ou appartienne à un compte suspendu."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('202 accepte', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "if (d.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('reset_token', d.token);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mot de passe oublié — adresse inconnue",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"personne@sekuu.com\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('202, comme pour un compte existant', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
              "pm.test('Aucun jeton emis', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.token).to.be.undefined);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Réinitialiser le mot de passe",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{reset_token}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{new_password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"] },
            "description": "Révoque **toutes** les sessions, sans exception : on ignore laquelle appartient à l'attaquant.\n\nVotre `access_token` devient donc inutilisable — reconnectez-vous avec `{{new_password}}`."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Mot de passe reinitialise', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Réutiliser un ancien mot de passe (422 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{reset_token}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"] },
            "description": "Les 5 derniers mots de passe sont refusés. Le jeton étant à usage unique, cette requête renvoie `RESET_TOKEN_INVALID` si la précédente a déjà réussi — demandez-en un nouveau pour tester `PASSWORD_RECENTLY_USED`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Vérifier l'adresse email",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{verification_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-email"] },
            "description": "Route publique : le lien est cliqué depuis une boîte mail, souvent sur un autre appareil qu'à l'inscription."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Adresse verifiee', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Renvoyer le lien de vérification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/resend-verification", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "resend-verification"] },
            "description": "Émettre un nouveau lien invalide le précédent."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
              "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "  if (d.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('verification_token', d.token);",
              "}"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Changer son mot de passe",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"current_password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{new_password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/users/{{user_id}}/change-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{user_id}}", "change-password"] },
            "description": "À la différence d'une réinitialisation, la session courante est conservée : l'appelant a prouvé qu'il connaît son mot de passe.\n\nRenseignez `user_id` depuis la réponse de `Profil (me)`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 — Sessions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Appareils connectés",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/sessions", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "sessions"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Liste renvoyee', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const sessions = pm.response.json().data;",
              "const other = sessions.find(s => !s.is_current);",
              "if (other) pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', other.id);",
              "pm.test('Une seule session courante', () => pm.expect(sessions.filter(s => s.is_current).length).to.be.at.most(1));"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Déconnecter un appareil",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/sessions/{{session_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "sessions", "{{session_id}}"] },
            "description": "La session d'un autre utilisateur renvoie 404, jamais 403."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Déconnexion",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Déconnexion de tous les appareils",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout-all", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout-all"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 — OAuth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Démarrer le flux",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/google/redirect", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "oauth", "google", "redirect"] },
            "description": "Renvoie l'URL d'autorisation plutôt qu'une redirection HTTP : l'API est consommée par des clients qui pilotent eux-mêmes la navigation.\n\nExige `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` et `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` dans `.env`."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('oauth_state', pm.response.json().data.state);",
              "}"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Fournisseur non supporté (422 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/myspace/redirect", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "oauth", "myspace", "redirect"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('422 OAUTH_PROVIDER_NOT_SUPPORTED', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('OAUTH_PROVIDER_NOT_SUPPORTED');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Callback avec un state fabriqué (400 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/google/callback?code=peu-importe&state=fabrique", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "oauth", "google", "callback"], "query": [{ "key": "code", "value": "peu-importe" }, { "key": "state", "value": "fabrique" }] },
            "description": "Le `state` protège du CSRF. Fabriqué, expiré, rejoué, ou émis pour un autre fournisseur : toujours refusé."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 OAUTH_STATE_INVALID', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('OAUTH_STATE_INVALID');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Comptes externes liés",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/accounts", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "oauth", "accounts"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const accounts = pm.response.json().data;",
              "if (accounts.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('oauth_account_id', accounts[0].id);"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Délier un compte externe",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/oauth/accounts/{{oauth_account_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "oauth", "accounts", "{{oauth_account_id}}"] },
            "description": "Refusé si c'est le dernier moyen de connexion d'un compte sans mot de passe."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 — Journal d'audit",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consulter le journal",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/audit-logs?per_page=10", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "audit-logs"], "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "10" }] },
            "description": "Requiert `audit.read`. Pagination **par curseur** : la collection est volumineuse et fortement écrite, l'offset y produirait doublons et oublis."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('Journal lisible', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const meta = pm.response.json().meta;",
              "pm.test('Pagination par curseur', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(meta).to.have.property('next_cursor');",
              "  pm.expect(meta).to.have.property('has_more');",
              "});",
              "if (meta.next_cursor) pm.collectionVariables.set('audit_cursor', meta.next_cursor);",
              "",
              "pm.test('Aucun secret dans les payloads', function () {",
              "  const raw = pm.response.text().toLowerCase();",
              "  pm.expect(raw).to.not.include('password_hash');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Page suivante (curseur)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/audit-logs?per_page=10&cursor={{audit_cursor}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "audit-logs"], "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "10" }, { "key": "cursor", "value": "{{audit_cursor}}" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtrer par action",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/audit-logs?filter[action]=workspace.created", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "audit-logs"], "query": [{ "key": "filter[action]", "value": "workspace.created" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Filtre inconnu (400 attendu)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/audit-logs?filter[secret]=x", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "audit-logs"], "query": [{ "key": "filter[secret]", "value": "x" }] },
            "description": "Un filtre silencieusement ignoré donnerait l'illusion d'une recherche exhaustive sur un journal d'audit."
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 INVALID_FILTER', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('INVALID_FILTER');",
              "});"
            ]}
          }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
